# Premium Button System v1.0 (CANONICAL · LOCKED)

SSOT: `components/ui/PremiumButton.tsx` + `PremiumButton.module.css`

## Variants

- **primary** — Visit Store, Browse, View Store, View All, Show More, Visit Profile (CTA family): purple gradient, liquid glass, premium shadow, subtle shine every ~7s
- **secondary** — alternate CTA (white, purple border/glow, same shine cadence)

## Rules

- One component only. No parallel Visit Store button designs.
- Shine: single subtle sweep every 6–8s, low opacity, transform-only, never continuous flash/RGB/neon.
- `prefers-reduced-motion`: disable shine and scale.
- Wire every new button in this family through `PremiumButton` / `PremiumButtonLink`.
- Social Follow / Follow Seller / Following variants are **permanently forbidden** (see `social-system-removal-v1.mdc`).

## Homepage search

Homepage search shows **search icon + placeholder only**. No camera / upload / image icon on Homepage.
